Third-party code in this folder
================================

battle-animations.ts and battle-animations-moves.ts are ported from the
Pokémon Showdown client, commit 1cf9b385a97ad5c77a25b91a1c799078827ec306:
https://github.com/smogon/pokemon-showdown-client/tree/1cf9b385a97ad5c77a25b91a1c799078827ec306/play.pokemonshowdown.com/src

The Showdown client as a whole is AGPL-3.0, but these source files carry their
own licences in their headers ("the battle replay/animation engine
(battle-*.ts) by itself is MIT"):

  - battle-animations.ts        @license MIT
  - battle-animations-moves.ts  @license CC0-1.0

Only the animation tables were kept; the scene adapter (scene.ts), the
coordinate helpers (coords.ts) and the types (types.ts) are original code of this repository (MIT, see the root
LICENSE). The fx images are loaded by URL from the client repository and are
not redistributed here.

